s://github.com/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service/pull/5","diff_url":"https://github.com/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service/pull/5.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service/pull/5.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-13T20:43:17Z"},"body":"This PR implements the CLI as described in the approved design documentation. The CLI is the endpoint of the remote job execution service, providing users with a simple UX for starting, stopping, monitoring, and streaming output from jobs.\r\n\r\nThe README and Makefile have been updated to support the CLI and `jobctl` binary.\r\n\r\nKey Details:\r\n- `--cert` flag allows users to run commands as admin, user, or unknown client\r\n- Unique job ID's are output for every new job started, allowing an easy means of interacting with each new job.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nUsage:\r\n\r\n`./bin/linuxjobctl <cmd> <args>`\r\n\r\nBy utilizing this path, the CLI maintains access to the certificates in `certs`. This is currently the method best utilizes for interacting with the CLI tool","closed_by":{"login":"MrChristianL","id":25303150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzAzMTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25303150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL","html_url":"https://github.com/MrChristianL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/received_events","type":"