303150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL","html_url":"https://github.com/MrChristianL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service/pulls/3","html_url":"https://github.com/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service/pull/3","diff_url":"https://github.com/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service/pull/3.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service/pull/3.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-13T20:42:45Z"},"body":"This PR implements the Server portion of the API as described in the approved design documentation. This includes the service’s core functionality for security, including RBAC authorization and mTLS authentication. The Server also implements the RPCs, and connects the service's key functionality to the Worker library\r\n\r\nKey Details:\r\n- mTLS authentication (TLS 1.3 enforced)\r\n- RBAC authorization (SAN identity-driven)\r\n- Thread-safe RPC implementation including `StartJob`, `StopJob`, `GetStatus`, and `StreamOutput`\r\n\r\nAdditional Details:\r\n\r\nUpdates to the README have been made to reflect the core components of the Server implementation. The Makefile has been updated for the Server.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nCurrent testing coverage for the Worker Library is **73.1%**, and is `-race` compliant.\r\n\r\nKey scenarios tested:\r\n- RPCs are limited based on user role\r\n- TLS enforced\r\n- Context cancellation of streams, not jobs\r\n- Streaming live and historical output","closed_by":{"login":"MrChristianL","id":25303150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzAzMTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25303150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL","html_url":"https://github.com/MrChristianL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service/issues/3/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service/issues/3/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service/issues/2","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service/issues/2/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos