s described in the approved design documentation. This includes the service’s core functionality as it pertains to job tracking and lifecycle management, output streaming, and concurrency support for multiple clients.\r\n\r\n**Key Details**:\r\n- Raw byte streaming with on-disk log files allows for complete historical and live output streaming\r\n- POSIX guarantees are leveraged to ensure all readers are able to access new data when output is written to disk\r\n- Broker’s support for `io.Writer` allows both stdout and stderr to be merged into a single, serialized writer.\r\n- `sync.Cond` is utilized to support multiple concurrent readers without polling or busy waiting.\r\n\r\n**Additional Details**:\r\n- Updates to the README have been made to reflect the core components of the Worker Library \r\n- A Makefile has been included. This allows for ease of use when running tests, as well as executing common commands necessary for the project.\r\n- Current testing coverage for the Worker Library is **87.4%**, and is `-race` compliant.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Note**: for the sake of completeness, I have included both the complete set of certificates used for the challenge at present, as well as the script used to generate them. In this way, you can either clone the repo and generate your own scripts or use those provided here. \r\n\r\nIn a production situation, certificates would never be included in a repo such as this.","closed_by":{"login":"MrChristianL","id":25303150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzAzMTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25303150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL","html_url":"https://github.com/MrChristianL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service/issues/2/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service/issues/2/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service/issues/1","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service/issues/1/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service/issues/1/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service/issues/1/events","html_url":"https://github.com/MrChristianL/Teleport-Job-Worker-Service/pull/1","id":4017241203,"node_id":"PR_kwDORZ4qNc7Hox3R","number":1,"title":"Design Specification and .proto for the remote job execution service (L4 implementation)","user":{"login":"MrChristianL","id":25303150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzAzMTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25303150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL","html_url":"https://github.com/MrChristianL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrChristianL/gists{/gist_